801"}, {"id": "20260628000951013131_a0abe8d6", "type": "Document", "source_id": 
"20260628000950836414_794245b5", "text": "This digitized record refers to Arthur
J. Evans’s 1925 monograph \"The ring of Nestor. A glimpse into the Minoan 
after-world and a sepulchral treasure of gold signet-rings and bead-seals from 
Thisbê, Boeotia,\" which discusses the so‑called Ring of Nestor and compares it 
to a broader assemblage of Minoan and Mycenaean gold signet rings and bead 
seals. The work situates the ring within funerary and religious contexts of the 
Aegean Bronze Age and is a key early publication defining the object as a 
Minoan‑style gold signet ring connected with Nestor and a Boeotian findspot at 
Thisbe."}, {"id": "20260628000951555389_3fa26cb0", "type": "Statement", 
"confidence": "medium", "qualifiers": [], "source_id": 
"20260628000950897471_08cb5845", "text": "The research on the pseudo‑Minoan 
