Pollio](https://independent.academia.edu/TNPollio)\n\nThis article will 
hopefully incentivize researchers to consider examining the untoward thousands 
of unprovenanced base metal and silver alloy finger rings being uncovered at 
sites from the U.K to Eurasia. Documented artifacts from controlled and 
stratified environments are of course essential towards understanding ring 
typology and routes of transmission across temporal and spatial environments. 
