[AIMessage → tool] task({'subagent_type': 'reporter', 'description': 'Write a 
full, self-contained, Wikipedia-style article titled "Ring of Nestor" based 
solely on the Research Graph for goal 20260628000909138431_feb1559e. Do NOT use 
