https://archiv.ub.uni-heidelberg.de/propylaeumdok/4408/1/Hudler_E-scaping%20argu
ments_2019.pdf\n\n[8] Historic Images of the Greek Bronze Age 
https://www.metmuseum.org/perspectives/historic-images-of-the-greek-bronze-age\n
\n[9] 'The Ring of Nestor': A Glimpse into the Minoan After-World and A 
